<title>FRANCE: ALPINE SKIING-WOMEN'S WORLD CUP SUPER-G WINNER PROFILE.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-WOMEN'S WORLD CUP SUPER-G WINNER PROFILE.</headline>
<dateline>VAL D'ISERE, France 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Profile of the winner of Thursday's women's World Cup super-G:</p>
<p>Name: Hilde Gerg</p>
<p>Age: 21</p>
<p>Nation: Germany</p>
<p>Previous World Cup victories: One super-G in Sierra Nevada (1994)</p>
<p>Other Facts: Dubbed &quot;Wilde Hilde&quot;, the most promising member of the German team has yet to win any honours in major championships</p>
</text>
